 165+ 79B4              Audio_MusicSheet:
 166+ 79B4                  ; Formato: db delay, durata (in frame a 50Hz)
 167+ 79B4 60 05 65 0F      db 96, 5, 101, 15, 96, 5, 107, 25, 152, 5, 143, 35, 107, 15, 96, 10
 167+ 79B8 60 05 6B 19
 167+ 79BC 98 05 8F 23
 167+ 79C0 6B 0F 60 0A
 168+ 79C4 6B 0A 60 0A      db 107, 10, 96, 10, 107, 25, 96, 10, 85, 10, 81, 10, 85, 5, 81, 10
 168+ 79C8 6B 19 60 0A
 168+ 79CC 55 0A 51 0A
 168+ 79D0 55 05 51 0A
 169+ 79D4 55 0A 60 46      db 85, 10, 96, 70, 72, 40, 81, 10, 76, 5, 85, 20, 96, 10, 107, 25
 169+ 79D8 48 28 51 0A
 169+ 79DC 4C 05 55 14
 169+ 79E0 60 0A 6B 19
 170+ 79E4 5A 14 72 05      db 90, 20, 114, 5, 107, 10, 90, 10, 96, 10, 107, 10, 96, 10, 85, 5
